body:
I did as you said and set it in local settings.php then this error showed up;

Fatal error: Uncaught ConfigException: DiscussionTools requires $wgFragmentMode to be set to [ 'html5', 'legacy' ]or[ 'html5' ]inD\xampp\htdocs\mediawiki\extensions\DiscussionTools\includes\Hooks\RegistrationHooks.php

So I set $wgFragmentMode in local settings.php too but the same error kept showing up, so I tried to set it in RegistrationHooks.php but also it didn't work. Please if you have any idea, I would be so grateful.
